and then we said oh look

04:34.033 --> 04:36.511
"the series itself, the infinite series,

04:36.511 --> 04:39.335
"you could view it as a limit of,

04:39.335 --> 04:41.412
"as n approaches infinity,
of the partial sum

04:41.412 --> 04:43.905
"S sub n and we said hey,
that approach infinity

04:43.905 --> 04:45.846
"this thing is diverging."
